Consider the following state - space representation of a linear time-invariant system.
<br>$$\mathop x\limits^ \bullet  \left( t \right) = \left[ {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   0 &amp; 2  \cr 

 } } \right]\,\,x\left( t \right),\,\,y\left( t \right) = {c^T}x\left( t \right),\,c = \left[ {\matrix{
   1  \cr 
   1  \cr 

 } } \right]$$ and 
<br>$$x\left( 0 \right) = \left[ {\matrix{
   1  \cr 
   1  \cr 

 } } \right]$$
<p>The value of $$y(t)$$ for $$t\,\,\, = \,\,{\log _e}2$$ ___________.</p>
